 "text": "Grain – United Equity\nClose\nHome\nFeeds\nGrain\nAgronomy\nLocations\nEmployment\nAbout\nWPS\nAccount\nSearch for:\nCategories\nFeeds\nHome Navigation\nLocations\nNews\nUncategorized\nMeta\nLog in\nEntries feed\nComments feed\nWordPress.org\nUnited Equity\nA Locally Owned Farm Based Cooperative\nHome\nFeeds\nGrain\nAgronomy\nLocations\nEmployment\nAbout\nWPS\nAccount\nGrain\nServing Grain Producers & Owners\nUnited Equity is committed to serving the grain producers and owners and assist them in marketing their product. We have three conveniently located facilities; one centralized in Delphos, Ohio, the second located on the north edge of Spencerville, Ohio and a third located at the intersection of St. Rte. 197 and St. Rte. 33 in Neptune, Ohio. All facilities are equipped to handle your wheat, corn and soybeans and our friendly staff would be happy to assist you at the facility most convenient for you!\nSoft Red Winter Wheat Discount Schedule ( pdf )\nSoybean Discount Schedule ( pdf )\nCorn Discount Schedule ( pdf )\nBack to top\n© United Equity, Inc.\n104 S. Main Street\nDelphos, OH 45833\n(419) 692-0811\n(419) 695-7807 fax\nHome\nFeeds\nGrain\nAgronomy\nLocations\nEmployment\nAbout\nWPS\nAccount\nSearch:",
